a:27:{s:9:"top_title";s:18:"HENAN WEIHUA GROUP";s:8:"top_text";s:680:"Henan Weihua Crane Co.,Ltd. located in crane hometown of China (cover more than 2/3 crane market in China), could supply you all kinds of industry cranes and other lifting equipment,more than 110 types, and capacity could be from 0.25tons to 900tons, pass GB/T 19001-2000 idt ISO 9001:2000, GB/T 24001-2004 idt ISO 14001:2004, GB/T 28001-2001,OHSAS 18001:1999, CE, GOST, SGS, TUV, BV and so on. 

Our Group have more than 4,500 employees, include one experienced and professional team for oversea market. We cover an area of 1,620,000 square meters, hold capital of RMB1.18 Billion, have more than 430 branches around the world and serving over 6,000 mid-to-high-end customers. ";s:11:"middle_text";s:500:"Meanwhile, our factory have passed CE, EAC, SGS, and OHSAS &amp; ISO9001:2000, ISO14001:1996 and ISO9001:2001, have the perfect quality-control system.

