f overhead cranes, gantry cranes, electric hoists, jib cranes and port cranes etc.. Nucleon has a registered capital of 80 million US dollars, covering an area of 430000 square meters, and owns more than 1500 employees. The company has equipped over 3000 sets of production and testing equipment, providing support for the research and development of high-quality crane equipment. The leading products have been widely used in pillar industries of the national economy such as metallurgy, energy and power, petrochemicals, railways, and aviation, and exported to various parts of the world.";s:10:"left_image";s:51:"admin/20260608/9e2393cb11713c428bcdaee0d43fcbe7.jpg";s:7:"do_desc";s:480:"At Weihua, we pursue technology-driven development and enhance our products and systems to the next level of automation by applications of artificial intelligence and IoT technology. We provide customers with bridge cranes, gantry cranes, electric hoists, intelligent multifunctional cranes, Automated Guided Vehicles (AGVs), bulk material handling equipment, port equipment &amp; comprehensive solutions, and the solutions for turn-key material hoisting and handling engineering.";s:12:"service_desc";s:181:"Our customers are mainly in the fields of metallurgy, steel, power, manufacturing, mining, railway, &lt;br&gt;

aerospace, petroleum, natural gas, chemical industries, ports, etc.";s:18:"market_description";s:680:"Nucleon is committed to the global market and strictly adheres to international crane standards. The company has introduced advanced production equipment to ensure that product craftsmanship and quality meet high international standards. Our products have been exported to over 100 countries and regions worldwide, reaching markets such as the Middle East, Southeast Asia, Africa, and the Americas. We provide global customers with safe, reliable, efficient, and intelligent integrated lifting and material handling solutions. At the same time, Nucleon actively responds to China&#039;s &quot;Belt and Road&quot; initiative and steadily advances its internationalization strategy.";s:16:"cert_description";s:714:"Quality is the cornerstone of Nucleon&#039;s operations. The company adheres to international standards during production, utilizing high standard raw materials and advanced manufacturing processes to ensure the highest product quality. Additionally, Nucleon Crane has established a comprehensive quality management system, overseeing every stage from design to after-sales service.

Safety is a top priority at Nucleon. We incorporate multiple safety features into our product designs and conduct regular maintenance and inspections to ensure the safe operation of our crane equipment. Our goal is to provide customers with secure and dependable hoisting equipment, significantly reducing the risk of accidents.";s:6:"market";a:4:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:"market_name";s:21:"Southeast Asia Market";s:10:"market_num";s:2:"16";}i:1;a:2:{s:11:"market_name";s:36:"Europe, America And Australia Market";s:10:"market_num";s:2:"88";}i:2;a:2:{s:11:"market_name";s:10:"CIS Market";s:10:"market_num";s:2:"17";}i:3;a:2:{s:11:"market_name";s:29:"Middle East And Africa Market";s:10:"market_num";s:2:"78";}}s:9:"advantage";a:4:{i:0;a:3:{s:14:"advantage_name";s:57:"Nucleon has a registered capital of 80 million US dollars";s:13:"advantage_num";s:2:"80";s:14:"advantage_unit";s:7:"Million";}i:1;a:3:{s:14:"advantage_name";s:48:"Nucleon covering an area of 430000 square meters";s:13:"advantage_num";s:6:"430000";s:14:"advantage_unit";s:3:"m²";}i:2;a:3:{s:14:"advantage_name";s:38:"Nucleon owns more than 1500 employees.";s:13:"advantage_num";s:4:"1500";s:14:"advantage_unit";s:9:"Employees";}i:3;a:3:{s:14:"advantage_name";s:71:"Nucleon has equipped over 3000 sets of production and testing equipment";s:13:"advantage_num";s:4:"3000";s:14:"advantage_unit";s:4:"Sets";}}s:4:"cert";a:12:{i:0;a:3:{s:3:"url";s:52:"admin/20260515/f4f3fa8afad001212da6b855ff63ae2a.webp";s:4:"name";s:21:"CE Certificate 2.webp";s:4:"desc";s:1:"1";}i:1;a:3:{s:3:"url";s:52:"admin/20260515/64ac0804e157e8438ffbbb0316515698.webp";s:4:"name";s:21:"CE Certificate 3.webp";s:4:"desc";s:1:"2";}i:2;a:3:{s:3:"url";s:52:"admin/20260515/b78638a8a2099069c9145a160ee89177.webp";s:4:"name";s:19:"CE Certificate.webp";s:4:"desc";s:1:"3";}i:3;a:3:{s:3:"url";s:52:"admin/20260515/c92b85eb43f57a6ad49797967116a562.webp";s:4:"name";s:14:"iso500001.webp";s:4:"desc";s:1:"4";}i:4;a:3:{s:3:"url";s:52:"admin/20260515/7e85bc2d54340a2a78c34768062de1fe.