webp";}i:1;a:3:{s:11:"create_name";s:9:"Ingenuity";s:11:"create_desc";s:437:"The production process of Weihua products is equipped with advanced and complete crane manufacturing technology, supporting equipment, and tooling systems. From steel pre-treatment, cutting, welding, to assembly, heat treatment, and painting, the entire product production process has strict process requirements and quality standards, ensuring that all aspects of product production meet process requirements and high quality standards.";s:12:"create_image";s:52:"admin/20260513/5c972b8bbc97a02adccf547c4072b782.webp";}i:2;a:3:{s:11:"create_name";s:8:"Creation";s:11:"create_desc";s:648:"Weihua has always taken internationalization, greening, intelligence, and digitization as its development strategy, with the goal of building a world-class high-end intelligent factory. Relying on the three major production bases of Changyuan, Zhengzhou, and Jiangsu, Weihua has built intelligent production workshops, equipped with robot welding and spraying intelligent production lines, specializing in the research and development and manufacturing of various lifting equipment, marine equipment, high-end intelligent equipment, etc. It produces more than 100000 sets of intelligent lifting logistics equipment and supporting products annually.";s:12:"create_image";s:52:"admin/20260513/3880cf30815b15b090737e5c55cefb8f.webp";}i:3;a:3:{s:11:"create_name";s:7:"Quality";s:11:"create_desc";s:647:"Quality is the lifeline of Weihua, and Weihua regards comprehensive quality management as the central link of enterprise management. The testing reports issued by Weihua National Accreditation Laboratories can be exchanged and recognized with more than 70 countries around the world. We have over 300 sets of testing equipment, including a 1000 ton test bench and a 100 ton electric hoist test bench. From raw materials and supporting components entering the factory to finished products leaving the factory, we establish strict process and testing standards at 180 main control nodes to ensure that the mechanical components are fully controlled.";s:12:"create_image";s:52:"admin/20260513/8fa75543c6b46df22480996749987fc6.webp";}}s:10:"service_bg";s:52:"admin/20260513/39f18ef28993741eb87c5938f5f434cd.webp";s:12:"market_image";s:52:"admin/20260608/65de4a9b8c65e68f2fc11b10765c850e.webp";s:10:"culture_bg";s:51:"admin/20260608/01fc941c4271a1104f97e4ef6c164233.jpg";s:15:"culture_card_bg";s:51:"admin/20260608/72181e3ce6ec5b23b34fc87cb2097cc7.png";s:19:"service_description";s:84:"Devoted to the development and research of cranes and material handling technologies";s:11:"engineering";a:6:{i:0;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:38:"Technical consultation and negotiation";s:12:"image_normal";s:52:"admin/20260608/94f198a5ee8e1cf2164eca79f4978cd8.webp";s:12:"image_active";s:52:"admin/20260608/f108f370f483b913b849114b2baa85aa.webp";}i:1;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:11:"Free design";s:12:"image_normal";s:52:"admin/20260608/da0377012184b521a4ab2f15f72931ed.webp";s:12:"image_active";s:52:"admin/20260608/1d5f0f2f6cda070db5c2fd214d6ebac1.webp";}i:2;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:30:"Installation and commissioning";s:12:"image_normal";s:52:"admin/20260608/0877dca02ac26cf2c8ea36b7d20a47a2.webp";s:12:"image_active";s:52:"admin/20260608/4bc8aa0fd3a4887e66355036f5208b81.webp";}i:3;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:8:"Training";s:12:"image_normal";s:52:"admin/20260608/a84d22dcaa9d7df41957171e238cb423.webp";s:12:"image_active";s:52:"admin/20260608/0506853e9deacb4900580b011cbcdd82.webp";}i:4;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:12:"Return visit";s:12:"image_normal";s:52:"admin/20260608/1b04ffab3594abbd46185cf81ffa843b.webp";s:12:"image_active";s:52:"admin/20260608/e371536f47a4fdcca1159f0c08d61800.webp";}i:5;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:18:"7*24 hours service";s:12:"image_normal";s:52:"admin/20260608/ce75733c53ed5a76a40aaf84fcea6ba2.webp";s:12:"image_active";s:52:"admin/20260608/aa7e28f452a53fc0338e8756860d595a.webp";}}s:13:"service_items";a:3:{i:0;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:16:"PRE-SALE SERVICE";s:4:"text";s:958:"Each department of the technical system has established a unified technical design and management platform - PLM system, which achieves resource sharing, unified data management, collaborative design, and remote collaborative design modes. Advanced design analysis software such as SolidWorks and SolidEdge are widely used, and the mainstream design methods based on CAD design, CAE analysis, digital modeling, and motion simulation are the main means of research and development.
We have adopted advanced parametric bridge crane CAD design and analysis software developed in cooperation with Huazhong University of Science and Technology in China. From quotation and scheme design to the generation of construction drawings that can be directly used in production, it can automatically generate. Various modern design and processing methods such as PDM, CAD, CAE, CAM, and CAPP are used to achieve optimized design and research and development of products.";s:5:"image";s:52:"admin/20260608/95d96e8e0825da54d1c94075dc0d0f5b.webp";}i:1;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:15:"IN-SALE SERVICE";s:4:"text";s:347:"Nucleon is committed to providing customers with systematic solutions, as well as streaming services and support. Faced with the sincere trust of tens of thousands of customers, Nucleon adheres to the service philosophy of &quot;enthusiasm, speed, professionalism, and perfection&quot;, systematizing, standardizing, and branding its service work.";s:5:"image";s:52:"admin/20260608/55fc1ccc952d9b78e6769e85ca9c9e3d.webp";}i:2;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:18:"AFTER-SALE SERVICE";s:4:"text";s:1164:"1.Any quality problems arising from various products produced and sold by our company shall be covered by the &quot;three guarantees&quot; service provided by our company in accordance with regulations, and the sales and service three guarantees team shall undertake this work.
2. After receiving information from users about product quality (such as phone calls, letters, or verbal notifications), immediately dispatch relevant personnel to the site to handle and solve the problem.
3. After sales service personnel should handle quality issues seriously, thoughtfully, and thoroughly to ensure timely use by users without any worries.
4. While promptly resolving quality issues with sold products, after-sales service personnel have the obligation to provide free technical consultation, training, and answer other product related questions to users.
5.Firmly establish the idea that the user is God and everything is for the sake of the user, handle quality issues promptly, seriously, and from start to finish, pay attention to reputation, maintain the company&#039;s image everywhere, and ensure the company&#039;s peace of mind and customer satisfaction.";s:5:"image";s:52:"admin/20260608/6b98679b1cb8653372c2004d34a462f1.webp";}}}